---
/**
 * RepoAsHarnessPlate — Act IV of the homepage four-act story block
 * ("The repository is the harness"), HP-09 in the illustration inventory.
 *
 * Two-layer editorial plate (refined-draft architecture):
 *   1. Art layer — engraved raster pair (light + dark, 1600×1000,
 *      transparent background) referenced from the canonical asset paths.
 *      The chest's hang-tags are deliberately BLANK in the art (text-free
 *      illustration rule) — their labels are the text layer below.
 *   2. Text layer — real, translatable HTML: the statement with its single
 *      oxblood emphasis word, the three mechanism points, and the five
 *      brand-term tag chips (SPEC / TASKS / CHECKS / STATE / TOOLS) rendered
 *      as HTML chips, never baked into the image.
 *
 * Inline 17-language i18n map + en fallback (docs/DIAGRAM_COMPONENTS.md §4).
 * Zero JS: static .astro, no <script>, no client:*, no motion. This is NOT
 * the ME-01 methodology diagram of the same concept: that diagram is a
 * separate component for a separate use case and is never imported or
 * wrapped here (one component per use case).
 */
import type { Language } from '@/lib/i18n';

